Files: crates/nn-app/assets/NekoHangul-Regular.ttf
Copyright: 2010, NHN Corporation (http://www.nhncorp.com),
 Font designed by Sandoll Communications Inc.
License: OFL-1.1
 A Hangul subset of NanumGothic Regular, renamed `Neko Hangul` because the
 licence's Reserved Font Name clause forbids a modified version keeping the
 name. The subset is compiled into the binary rather than installed as a file,
 and the licence has to travel with it either way: the full text is in
 `crates/nn-app/assets/OFL.txt`.

